Test: str() function
--------------------------------------
  str(0): 0
  str(42): 42
  str(-123): -123
  str(999999): 999999
  str(3.14): 3.14
  str(-2.5): -2.5
  str("hello"): hello
  str(""): 
  str([1,2,3]): [1, 2, 3]

  Comparison with empty string concatenation:
  "" myinteger: 42
  str(myinteger): 42
  (should be equal): 1
